</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d341bc62-86d9-11f1-b6bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-23T205955Z-1910357374-RC2WJMAQWY12-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d341bc62-86d9-11f1-b6bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-23T205955Z-1910357374-RC2WJMAQWY12-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d8d12f46-86d9-11f1-b0e2-31fc64c1b9e6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 21:02:52 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d341bc62-86d9-11f1-b6bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-23T205955Z-1910357374-RC2WJMAQWY12-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg">REUTERS - Evelyn Hockstein</source><dc:creator>华盛顿特约记者 陈米亚</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>特朗普宣布习近平9月24日访美 人工智能将成会谈议题</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260723-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B39%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A5%E8%AE%BF%E7%BE%8E-%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%B0%86%E6%88%90%E4%BC%9A%E8%B0%88%E8%AE%AE%E9%A2%98</link><description>
