</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f9e7ed7a-8682-11f1-a908-157a6b6090b8</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 10:41:00 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b28da352-4d2f-11f1-aa41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B28P9KT.jpg">AFP - AARON FAVILA</source><dc:creator>罗拉</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国向联合国递网络治理立场 促各国不搞数智霸权 勿迫人站队搞破坏</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260723-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%90%91%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%92%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E6%B2%BB%E7%90%86%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA-%E4%BF%83%E5%90%84%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8D%E6%90%9E%E6%95%B0%E6%99%BA%E9%9C%B8%E6%9D%83-%E5%8B%BF%E8%BF%AB%E4%BA%BA%E7%AB%99%E9%98%9F%E6%90%9E%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F</link><description>
